@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Eliminar Espacio

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "SpaceCrudConsole" as Console
participant "DeleteSpaceUseCase" as UC
participant "SpaceRepository" as Repo
database "JSON (spaces.json)" as DB

Admin -> Console: Seleccionar espacio para eliminar
activate Console
Console --> Admin: ¿Está seguro de eliminar el espacio?
Admin --> Console: Sí
Console -> UC: execute(id)
activate UC
UC -> Repo: deleteById(id)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: Eliminar registro
activate DB
DB --> Repo: success
deactivate DB
Repo --> UC: success
deactivate Repo
UC --> Console: success
deactivate UC
Console --> Admin: Mostrar confirmación de eliminación
deactivate Console

@enduml
